    "text": "Affirmation of the Day: I have self-control. I have the chops to stay consistent. My down time is just as important as my time of action. Making sure I’m good is top tier respect for myself and others. I may not always get it right, but I’m trying, and that’s what matters. I am no longer forcing things and entering a new phase of becoming, and that feels so damn good. 🧡\n\nWhich slides are speaking to you today?",
